    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleetbreakers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberate the galaxy from the evil Voltari Empire in this action strategy, sci-fi roguelike where fast-paced action combat meets deep, strategic squadron management. Fleetbreakers flips the strategy genre into something new by blending quick and rewarding gameplay with the depth and replayability that strategy games are known for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/580bb0cc6b509660945f63e9c1c0c963.poster.avif?t=1751926364\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/580bb0cc6b509660945f63e9c1c0c963.webm?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/580bb0cc6b509660945f63e9c1c0c963.mp4?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop, Deploy, Destroy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your fleet of squadrons from a diverse set of ships, each with their own abilities advantages, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Mothership to construct powerful stations and activate special support abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily control, command, and deploy your squadrons to explore the map or engage the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/9029c8901511b31a52583f8ec9915161.poster.avif?t=1751926364\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/9029c8901511b31a52583f8ec9915161.webm?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/9029c8901511b31a52583f8ec9915161.mp4?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign overmap gives you control of each run, generating unique encounters with their own challenges and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions to out maneuver the enemy and turn the tide of battle as the campaign unfolds before your eyes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2293b500f7616056b4c27f1b81dd8034.poster.avif?t=1751926364\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2293b500f7616056b4c27f1b81dd8034.webm?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2293b500f7616056b4c27f1b81dd8034.mp4?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Don\u2019t Succeed.. Fight Again</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom isn\u2019t free. Grow your strength by completing missions, collecting rewards, and rejoining the fight against the Voltari.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions are fast-paced and highly replayable: giving players the opportunity to try new tactics and approaches to every new challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression systems with robust procedural maps ensure that each encounter is different. There is always something new to discover in space</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most action strategy titles, Fleetbreakers is fully playable with both a controller or a mouse and keyboard</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleetbreakers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberate the galaxy from the evil Voltari Empire in this action strategy, sci-fi roguelike where fast-paced action combat meets deep, strategic squadron management. Fleetbreakers flips the strategy genre into something new by blending quick and rewarding gameplay with the depth and replayability that strategy games are known for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/580bb0cc6b509660945f63e9c1c0c963.poster.avif?t=1751926364\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/580bb0cc6b509660945f63e9c1c0c963.webm?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/580bb0cc6b509660945f63e9c1c0c963.mp4?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop, Deploy, Destroy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your fleet of squadrons from a diverse set of ships, each with their own abilities advantages, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Mothership to construct powerful stations and activate special support abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily control, command, and deploy your squadrons to explore the map or engage the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/9029c8901511b31a52583f8ec9915161.poster.avif?t=1751926364\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/9029c8901511b31a52583f8ec9915161.webm?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/9029c8901511b31a52583f8ec9915161.mp4?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign overmap gives you control of each run, generating unique encounters with their own challenges and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions to out maneuver the enemy and turn the tide of battle as the campaign unfolds before your eyes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2293b500f7616056b4c27f1b81dd8034.poster.avif?t=1751926364\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2293b500f7616056b4c27f1b81dd8034.webm?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929040/extras/2293b500f7616056b4c27f1b81dd8034.mp4?t=1751926364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Don\u2019t Succeed.. Fight Again</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom isn\u2019t free. Grow your strength by completing missions, collecting rewards, and rejoining the fight against the Voltari.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions are fast-paced and highly replayable: giving players the opportunity to try new tactics and approaches to every new challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression systems with robust procedural maps ensure that each encounter is different. There is always something new to discover in space</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most action strategy titles, Fleetbreakers is fully playable with both a controller or a mouse and keyboard</p>",
